      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>Navigator</b> \xB7 NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026 \xB7 Guacalita Inc.\n\n<b><color=#33CCFF>NASA DATA</color></b>\nReal-time planet positions: NASA/JPL Horizons System.\nMission facts, \u0394V, orbit insertions, probes, planets and moons: NASA Science and NASA/JPL mission pages.\nGravity-assist routes: MESSENGER, Galileo, Cassini and Voyager 2 (NASA/JPL).\n\n<b><color=#33CCFF>SKY IMAGES</color></b>\nOrion Nebula: NASA, ESA, M. Robberto (STScI/ESA), Hubble Orion Treasury Project Team.\nHelix Nebula: NASA/JPL-Caltech (Spitzer).\nPillars of Creation: NASA, ESA, Hubble Heritage Team (STScI/AURA).\nRing Nebula: NASA, ESA, Hubble Heritage (STScI/AURA)-ESA/Hubble Collaboration (CC BY 4.0).\nWhirlpool Galaxy (M51): NASA, ESA, S. Beckwith (STScI), Hubble Heritage Team.\nHubble Deep Field South: NASA, ESA, HDF-S team (STScI).\nM87* black hole: Event Horizon Telescope Collaboration (CC BY 4.0).\nCarina Nebula, Horsehead Nebula and Andromeda: Wikimedia Commons (authors and licenses in CREDITS.md).\n\n<b><color=#33CCFF>3D MODELS</color></b>\nGenerated with Meshy AI.\n\n<b><color=#33CCFF>SOFTWARE</color></b>\nUnity 6 \xB7 glTFast (Apache 2.0) \xB7 ZXing.Net (Apache 2.0) \xB7 flutter_embed_unity (MIT) \xB7 Flutter \xB7 Iroh P2P (MIT/Apache 2.0) \xB7 Liberation Sans (SIL OFL).\nAll sounds are synthesized in code."
